Logitech Wireless Illuminated Keyboard K800 delivers a brilliant typing experience &ndash; day or night. You can type easily &ndash; even in the dark &ndash; with brightly backlit, laser-etched keys that provide precise, adjustable illumination. With sleek lines, a clear edge and low-profile keys, the streamlined design adds style to your workspace &ndash; whether you've got a laptop or desktop. You'll also enjoy comfortable, fluid and whisper-quiet typing with the PerfectStroke key system and durable Logitech Incurve keys that cradle your fingertips. And your keyboard is always ready when you need it thanks to the micro-USB cable that lets you recharge while you type and the tiny Logitech Unifying receiver that you can plug and forget.<br/>Vendor Homepage: http://www.logitech.com/en-us/product/wireless-illuminated-keyboard-k800<br/>KB language: ENG/RUS<br/>OS compatibility / Windows 7: Yes<br/>OS compatibility / Windows Vista: Yes<br/>OS compatibility / Windows XP: Yes<br/>Included Accessories: Logitech Unifying receiver;
